pan begin="01:38.670" end="01:40.020">busy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.020" end="01:46.410"><span begin="01:40.020" end="01:40.410">Andyou're </span><span begin="01:40.410" end="01:40.920">doing </span><span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.070">your </span><span begin="01:41.070" end="01:41.550">best </span><span begin="01:41.550" end="01:41.970">to </span><span begin="01:41.970" end="01:42.600">avoid </span><span begin="01:42.600" end="01:43.710">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.410" end="01:50.160"><span begin="01:46.410" end="01:46.590">I'm </span><span begin="01:46.590" end="01:47.100">starting </span><span begin="01:47.100" end="01:47.220">to </span><span begin="01:47.220" end="01:47.520">think </span><span begin="01:47.520" end="01:47.910">one </span><span begin="01:47.910" end="01:48.540">dayI'll </span><span begin="01:48.540" end="01:48.810">tell </span><span begin="01:48.810" end="01:48.930">the </span><span begin="01:48.930" end="01:49.560">story </span><span begin="01:49.560" end="01:49.740">of </span><span begin="01:49.740" end="01:50.160">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.160" end="01:53.670"><span begin="01:50.160" end="01:50.370">How </span><span begin="01:50.370" end="01:50.550">I </span><span begin="01:50.550" end="01:50.730">was </span><span begin="01:50.730" end="01:51.150">losing </span><span begin="01:51.150" end="01:51.330">my </span><span begin="01:51.330" end="01:51.780">mind </span><span begin="01:51.780" end="01:52.170">when </span><span begin="01:52.170" end="01:52.260">I </span><span begin="01:52.260" end="01:52.650">saw </span><span begin="01:52.650" end="01:53.040">you </span><span begin="01:53.040" end="01:53.520">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.670" end="02:00.840"><span begin="01:53.670" end="01:53.940">But </span><span begin="01:53.940" end="01:54.090">you </span><span begin="01:54.090" end="01:54.420">held </span><span begin="01:54.420" end="01:54.750">your </span><span begin="01:54.750" end="01:55.440">pride </span><span begin="01:55.440" end="01:55.680">like </span><span begin="01:55.680" end="01:55.800">you </span><span begin="01:55.800" end="01:56.160">should </span><span begin="01:56.160" end="01:56.250">have </span><span begin="01:56.250" end="01:56.910">held</span><span begin="01:56.910" end="02:00.780"> </span><span begin="02:00.780" end="02:00.840">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.840" end="02:02.640"><span begin="02:00.840" end="02:00.930">Ohwe're </span><span begin="02:00.930" end="02:01.290">scared </span><span begin="02:01.290" end="02:01.350">to </span><span begin="02:01.350" end="02:01.680">see </span><span begin="02:01.680" end="02:01.920">the </span><span begin="02:01.920" end="02:02.640">ending</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.640" end="02:06.780"><span begin="02:02.640" end="02:03.000">Why </span><span begin="02:03.000" end="02:03.150">are </span><span begin="02:03.150" end="02:03.330">we </span><span begin="02:03.330" end="02:04.440">pretending </span><span begin="02:04.440" end="02:04.980">this </span><span begin="02:04.980" end="02:05.220">is </span><span begin="02:05.220" end="02:06.630">nothing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.780" end="02:10.440"><span begin="02:06.780" end="02:06.960">I'd </span><span begin="02:06.960" end="02:07.260">tell </span><span begin="02:07.260" end="02:07.500">you </span><span begin="02:07.500" end="02:07.620">I </span><span begin="02:07.620" end="02:08.070">miss </span><span begin="02:08.070" end="02:08.250">you </span><span begin="02:08.250" end="02:08.610">but </span><span begin="02:08.610" end="02:09.120">Idon't </span><span begin="02:09.120" end="02:09.540">know </span><span begin="02:09.540" end="02:10.260">how</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.440" end="02:14.250"><span begin="02:10.440" end="02:10.650">I've </span><span begin="02:10.650" end="02:11.040">never </span><span begin="02:11.040" end="02:11.400">heard </span><span begin="02:11.400" end="02:12.150